ow, please let us know so we can adjust prior to posting.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">Reason:</span></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"\">Reclassification – Activate old JC</span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\"><a id=\"OWAAM186B20CD7455485EBAC62211E1B5D0E5\" href=\"mailto:Gina.Vieira@tidalhealth.org\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; text-decoration:none\">@Gina Vieira</span></a> please let Lynne know next steps for the position in terms of posting and filling.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">Title:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">Lead Coder</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">PL/CC/JC</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">PL 13 &nbsp;/ CC 9155 &nbsp;/ JC 1013</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height:16.55pt\"><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height:16.55pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">Grade:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height:16.55pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">18</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">Salary Range:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">$24.41 - $37.84 (5% lead diff)</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">FLSA:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">Non-Exempt/Hourly</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">License:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">No</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">FTE Leader:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">No</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">Direct Supervision:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">None</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">FTE:</span></b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">1.0 </span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">Reports to:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">Coding Operations Manager</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">Job Description Status:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">In progress, information for posting is below</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">Position Summary:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">The Lead Coder for Physician Coding accurately abstracts pertinent information from the patient record to apply the appropriate diagnostic and procedural codes to individual professional fee encounters for data submission/analysis and claims processing. This position adheres to the Official ICD-10 Coding Guidelines and the American Academy of Professional Coders’ (AAPC) Code of Ethics and maintains established productivity and quality standards. The Lead Coder will demonstrate continual learning by attending coding webinars and audit review sessions. In addition to a coding case load, the Lead Coder’s job is to support the coding team by researching and answering coding and documentation questions, participate in Epic and Solventum 360 Pro Fee projects and initiatives, to provide training and support as requested by the manager, and to collaborate with other departments such as Billing ensure proper coding and reimbursement and reduced denials.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">Education:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"\">High school diploma or equivalent required.</span></li><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"\">Completion of medical terminology course and/or anatomy and physiology preferred.</span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">Certification/Licensure:</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"\">CCA or CCS through the American Health Information Management Association OR CPC-A or CPC through the American Academy of Professional Coders is required.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">Experience:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\"><a name=\"_Hlk215476528\"></a>Experience with ICD-10 CM, CPT-4, and HCPCS code assignments required.</li><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\">Minimum of one (1) year direct Profee (PB) coding experience preferred.</li><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\">Experience with the EPIC Electronic Health Record and the 3m 360 Computer Assistant Coding System is preferred.</li></ul><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">Schedule:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"\">Monday – Friday, primarily day shift.</span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">Please let me know if you have any questions.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Erin Cowder</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Compensation Analyst</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">People Department</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Tidal Health</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">tidalhealth.org</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><i><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></i></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p></div></body></html>","bodyType":"html"}